    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153750/extras/fb876da295ae7363805d42d5e44ede72.avif?t=1754662115\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>The world has changed...</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Years of massive industrialization and overexploitation have deeply disrupted the climate, making it unstable and triggering violent storms as well as major ecological shifts.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>In the face of this situation, you\u2019ve been forced to start over on new lands. Your task is to rebuild a sustainable society while avoiding the mistakes of the past, in a changing world where food has become a currency.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A strategic, immersive, and eco\u2011friendly city builder</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You take on the role of the leader of a new colony. Your mission is to build a modern city where food production is at the heart of survival and prosperity. Construction, resource management, citizen satisfaction, and adaptation to climate events form the pillars of your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Environmental challenges, such as <strong>climate change and pollution</strong>, pose major threats and require careful attention to prevent <strong>collateral damage and public unrest</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153750/extras/a06ee47362e07bf87a83bbf0b5dcd7dc.avif?t=1754662115\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2713 <strong>Agriculture</strong>: Sow and harvest fields of grains, fruits, and vegetables, and raise farm animals for their food resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153750/extras/79e9fca8881208f99cb938488981f471.poster.avif?t=1754662115\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153750/extras/79e9fca8881208f99cb938488981f471.webm?t=1754662115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153750/extras/79e9fca8881208f99cb938488981f471.mp4?t=1754662115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2713 <strong>Construction &amp; Management</strong>: Build and expand your city while balancing the needs of your citizens and overcoming the challenges of food production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2713 <strong>Dynamic Economy</strong>: Manage your economy by establishing markets, efficiently supplying them with a wide variety of goods, and adapting to the ever\u2011changing needs of the population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2713 <strong>Detailed Industry</strong>: Construct production lines machine by machine. Repair, upgrade, and research new line blueprints. Process and assemble agricultural resources into new products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153750/extras/68051946f579f684725d1c73f252b64e.poster.avif?t=1754662115\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153750/extras/68051946f579f684725d1c73f252b64e.webm?t=1754662115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2713 <strong>Interactive Environments</strong>: Face climate events that impact your agriculture, industry, and citizens, putting your management skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153750/extras/4c031850dff0e3bcabcb1dadf0918e14.poster.avif?t=1754662115\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153750/extras/4c031850dff0e3bcabcb1dadf0918e14.webm?t=1754662115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1153750/extras/4c031850dff0e3bcabcb1dadf0918e14.mp4?t=1754662115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2713 <strong>Energy Resources</strong>: Extract oil, collect water, and generate electricity through power plants or wind turbines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2713 <strong>Immersive Graphics</strong>: Dive into a rich visual world with detailed and colorful graphics. Experience an engaging sound design where the fury of storms contrasts with the calm that follows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Technologies</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2713 <strong>Research &amp; Development</strong>: The main tech tree that allows you to progress through the ages. Unlock new buildings, technologies, and various upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2713 <strong>Employment Center &amp; Task Automation</strong>: Automate most tasks as your city grows and gain additional improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2713 <strong>Design Office</strong>: Discover and optimize new blueprints for automated production lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2713 <strong>Protection Factory</strong>: Produce protective tools to help your population withstand storms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Weather Effects</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2713 <strong>Weather</strong>: As you progress, face unpredictable weather conditions and adapt your actions to their effects in different sectors of activity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2713 <strong>Pollution</strong>: A pollution system that increases the frequency and duration of storms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Food Industry</strong> is designed for fans of construction, strategy, and management games who want to tackle challenges while letting their creativity run free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A city builder that\u2019s perfect for both seasoned players and newcomers to the genre, allowing everyone to progress at their own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>One person's work</u>: I'm an independent developer and I'm counting on you to be lenient in your criticism. If you have any questions or objections, please feel free to contact me via private message or Discord.</strong><i> </i></h2>",
